Package: genr
Title: R Bindings for the Gen Sequence Graph Database
Version: 0.5.1
Authors@R:
    person("GenHub", "Bio", email = "opensource@genhub.bio", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R bindings for the Gen sequence graph database and version control
    system. The package embeds the Rust Gen engine via extendr and exposes a
    Repository interface for importing, updating, exporting, and visualising
    sequence graphs. Supports FASTA, GFA, GenBank, and VCF workflows, as well
    as combinatorial library design and Bioconductor DNAStringSet/GRanges input.
License: Apache License 2.0 + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/genhub-bio/gen
BugReports: https://github.com/genhub-bio/gen/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
SystemRequirements: Prebuilt release binaries require no external toolchain;
    source builds require Cargo (Rust toolchain), libclang, and Cap'n Proto
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    anyhtmlwidget,
    jsonlite,
    methods,
    shiny
Remotes:
    keller-mark/anyhtmlwidget@be23d31587b3b0986febef00ba27567e46dc3338
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
NeedsCompilation: yes
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
Config/rextendr/version: 0.5.0
